=== 正确使用虚析构函数 ===

场景1：通过基类指针删除
Base constructor, allocating baseData_
Derived constructor, allocating derivedData_
Derived destructor, freeing derivedData_
Base destructor, freeing baseData_

场景2：使用智能指针
Base constructor, allocating baseData_
Derived constructor, allocating derivedData_
Derived destructor, freeing derivedData_
Base destructor, freeing baseData_

场景3：多态容器
Base constructor, allocating baseData_
Derived constructor, allocating derivedData_
Derived destructor, freeing derivedData_
Base destructor, freeing baseData_
